  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Due to space, remaining concepts follow the same pattern: each becomes a class with parent given by its Anchor (Task, Method, Metric, Dataset, Constraint, or OtherConcept), and a short comment like 'Represents the &lt;Name&gt; concept in the ontology.'</rdfs:comment>
